WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.720
You ever feel like you're waiting for something that happened...

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.220
It pains me to see you embarrass your father.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.440
...but you don't know what it is.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:37.500
You're in, or you're out.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.560
That thing that could make your life special.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:44.290
You're in...

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:46.540
...or you're out.

00:00:47.489 --> 00:00:49.489
You're in...

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.130
or you're out.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:55.439
How can I tell you if I'm in or I'm out without you telling you the first thing about what I might be in or out of?

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:57.780
This would be something dangerous...

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.140
...and very exciting

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:07.600
This library is home to the most valuable book in the United States.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.880
Twelve million dollars.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:15.500
You really need to see how easy this is gonna be.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.160
Oh, you know this from all your previous heist?

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:27.760
Can I just say how dumb this entire thing is?

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:29.300
How do you know no one's gonna get hurt ?

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:34.620
I don't want you waking up years from now, wondering...

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:37.649
What could have happened, and who you could have been?

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:40.380
Are you sure you're okay?

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:46.480
Oh sh-

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:48.640
This is my life, this isn't some game!

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.900
Can you please do not touch..

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.360
...the model? Thanks.

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:23.180
Let's do this.

